set {flags.intro_done} = true
[text_input var="game.player_first" text="First name:" placeholder="Adrian" default="Adrian"]
[text_input var="game.player_last" text="Last name:" placeholder="Cole" default="Cole"]
- "He / Him"
	set {game.player_gender} = "male"
- "She / Her"
	set {game.player_gender} = "female"
- "They / Them"
	set {game.player_gender} = "neutral"
do GameState.build_player_name()
Mind Harvest — {game.player_formal}, Licensed Therapist.
Day one. The lease is signed, the couch is second-hand, and the coffee machine is borrowed.
Bea, who apparently came with the building, is already at the front desk — coffee in hand, eyebrow raised.
jump morning_menu/